1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,209
I am a neurologist.

2
00:00:02,249 --> 00:00:06,944
Every week, I discharge
stroke patients to go home.

3
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:16,426
They go home with an
exercise programme on paper.

4
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:23,500
At home, they often forget, and are
unsure whether they move correctly.

5
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:26,987
Yet recovery depends on
daily exercise at home,

6
00:00:27,027 --> 00:00:29,500
and that is exactly where
guidance breaks off.

7
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:34,777
PULIHIN turns an ordinary phone
into an exercise companion.

8
00:00:34,817 --> 00:00:39,500
Once opened, Today's Exercises
appear right away, in large type.

9
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:43,783
We start with one small
movement: Elbow Flexion.

10
00:00:43,823 --> 00:00:49,500
There is a movement demo, a safety notice,
then one big button: Start with Camera.

11
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:55,275
The phone simply sits on a table,
about one metre from the chair.

12
00:00:55,315 --> 00:01:00,648
What you see here is a demonstration
by a performer, not a real patient.

13
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:07,694
The camera reads body landmarks right on
this phone, without uploading any video.

14
00:01:07,734 --> 00:01:10,796
Each repetition is counted
from the elbow angle:

15
00:01:10,836 --> 00:01:14,648
a full bend, straighten again,
and only then does it count.

16
00:01:16,500 --> 00:01:19,014
Look at the count: five out of ten.

17
00:01:19,054 --> 00:01:22,080
It only rises when a movement is complete,

18
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:26,426
and the app speaks up when the
movement is not quite right.

19
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:32,800
Now the shoulder hikes up.

20
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:37,400
[App voice] Relax your shoulder,
lower your shoulder.

21
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:43,400
The app gives a form correction,
by voice and in large text, in Indonesian.

22
00:01:44,500 --> 00:01:50,151
The performer lowers the shoulder, the
message clears, and counting continues.

23
00:01:50,191 --> 00:01:54,204
Only one message at a time,
so it never gets confusing.

24
00:01:58,500 --> 00:02:01,527
So it is not just counting:
it guards how each

25
00:02:01,567 --> 00:02:05,167
movement is done, all the
way to the tenth repetition.

26
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:13,588
At the end of the session there is a score

27
00:02:13,628 --> 00:02:17,759
and a simple summary:
repetitions, duration and one tip.

28
00:02:17,799 --> 00:02:21,260
The labels are easy to read,
from Needs Support

29
00:02:21,300 --> 00:02:23,981
and Improving to Good and Very Good.

30
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:33,094
This summary is not a diagnosis.

31
00:02:33,134 --> 00:02:37,167
That disclaimer appears
on every session summary.

32
00:02:42,500 --> 00:02:46,975
Back on the home screen,
today's status has changed to done.

33
00:02:47,015 --> 00:02:51,907
The exercise is recorded on the phone,
and the family can see it.

34
00:03:00,500 --> 00:03:02,671
The family no longer has to guess.

35
00:03:02,711 --> 00:03:06,053
On the For Family page,
the caregiver sees adherence

36
00:03:06,093 --> 00:03:09,019
over the last seven days
and the score trend.

37
00:03:15,500 --> 00:03:19,807
If exercise stops for several
days, a clear flag appears.

38
00:03:19,847 --> 00:03:25,796
The weekly summary can be copied with
one tap, ready to send to the therapist.

39
00:03:30,500 --> 00:03:34,492
For patients with speech
difficulties, or aphasia,

40
00:03:34,532 --> 00:03:40,500
there is Speech Practice in Indonesian,
with words used at home every day.

41
00:03:42,500 --> 00:03:46,500
The performer listens to the
example, then says the word.

42
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:54,373
The app listens and scores the attempt.

43
00:03:54,413 --> 00:03:59,400
A correct word is marked Correct,
and the score is saved.

44
00:04:00,500 --> 00:04:04,889
On the clinician dashboard,
the therapist can set the programme

45
00:04:04,929 --> 00:04:08,796
and follow progress without
waiting for the next visit.

46
00:04:12,500 --> 00:04:16,201
In this prototype,
the programme the therapist saves

47
00:04:16,241 --> 00:04:19,981
becomes Today's Exercises on
that patient's profile.

48
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:28,888
PULIHIN does not replace the therapist.

49
00:04:28,928 --> 00:04:32,473
It helps make sure that what the therapist

50
00:04:32,513 --> 00:04:35,500
teaches is truly practised at home.

51
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:40,786
This is still a competition prototype,

52
00:04:40,826 --> 00:04:44,070
not a regulated medical device.

53
00:04:44,110 --> 00:04:47,500
You can try it at pulihinapp.id.
